T(n,m):=if n=0 and m=0 then 1 else if n=0 then 0 else if oddp(n-1) then (2*binomial(n/2,m)*binomial(n/2,m+1)*(n/2+1))/n else binomial((n+1)/2,m+1)*sum((-1)^(k-1)*binomial((n+1)/2,m-k+1),k,1,(n+1)/2);
